{"4452320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Woodbridge", "steam_appid": 4452320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>What is Woodbridge?</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Woodbridge is an ever expanding game and will be for the foreseeable future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It never started out with a set story or plot. From the beginning I didn’t know what it was going to be and that still holds true for my recent development work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’m making it up as I go along and so far the story that has spontaneously developed is turning out to be pretty good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have around 800 hours of dev time into it and my last playthrough was around 25 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I think someone that has never played the game may take around 30 or to reach the current end  of development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is not complete, yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long until it’s finally finished?  I don’t know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years maybe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps in a decade from now, as I keep adding and developing it, I will finally tie up all loose ends and have a final conclusion and closure to the story, and end up with a game with 200 hours of playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I invite you to come along for the ride and see where it goes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure game created with RPG maker with gear progression, unique new skills and abilities along with a mysterious and interesting storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >800+ hours of development time with a playthrough time of 30 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > All in game music is original and was composed by me using Noteflight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >============================================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After rescuing little Keeshan from his enslavement of mining crystals for the Golden claw clan, your curiosity about a mysterious crystal leads you to seek the wisdom of the old hermit that lives in the highlands of Lentak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hermit then pulls you into a quest to save all of Lentak from the Evil Khaz!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to survive the vicious Berry Bears or the deadly Volcano bees?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t leave home without enough Goldberry pie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone loves Goldberry pie!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure game created with RPG maker with gear progression, unique new skills and abilities along with a mysterious and interesting storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >800+ hours of development time with a playthrough time of 30 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > All in game music is original and was composed by me using Noteflight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >============================================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After rescuing little Keeshan from his enslavement of mining crystals for the Golden claw clan, your curiosity about a mysterious crystal leads you to seek the wisdom of the old hermit that lives in the highlands of Lentak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hermit then pulls you into a quest to save all of Lentak from the Evil Khaz!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to survive the vicious Berry Bears or the deadly Volcano bees?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t leave home without enough Goldberry pie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone loves Goldberry pie!</p>", "short_description": "An adventure game created with RPG maker with gear progression, unique new skills and abilities along with a mysterious and interesting storyline. 800+ hours of development time with a playthrough time of 30 hours. All in game music is original 